            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2.5 w-full sm:w-auto">
              <a
                href="#social-proof-engine"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-300 active:scale-[0.98] text-[#022C22] font-extrabold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-[0_6px_20px_rgba(52,211,153,0.35)] transition-colors touch-manipulation"
              >Watch Real Buyer Stories</a>
              <a
                href="#authority-vault"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-transparent hover:bg-white/10 border border-amber-300/60 text-amber-200 font-bold text-sm px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-colors touch-manipulation"
              >Meet the Founder</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
            {/* Real customer story — quote must stay faithful to the video (see StoreSocialProof.astro) */}
            <figure class="w-full max-w-[340px] rounded-2xl bg-white text-[#111827] p-5 shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                <span class="text-amber-500 text-sm tracking-tight" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5">★★★★★</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
              </div>
              <blockquote class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                “I used to wake up sluggish. Within 3 weeks on Sujata spirulina, my energy stays steady till late night.”
